  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Boil the kettle.\n• Tear kale leaves from stems, then roughly chop leaves.\n• Thinly slice pear into wedges.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb814db53750fd705ece5/step-092e0646.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Pour the boiled water into a large saucepan over high heat. Add a pinch of salt and bring to the boil.\n• Cook orecchiette in the boiling water until 'al dente', 8 minutes.\n• Reserve some pasta water (1/4 cup for 2 people / 1/2 cup for 4 people), then drain pasta and return to saucepan. TIP: 'Al dente' pasta is cooked through but still slightly firm in the centre.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb814db53750fd705ece5/step-8a1d737e.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, heat a large frying pan over high heat with a drizzle of olive oil.\n• Cook snacking tomatoes, stirring occasionally, until blistered, 3-5 minutes.\n• Reduce heat to medium. Add kale and cook until wilted, 1-2 minutes.\n• Add basil pesto, light cooking cream, cooked orecchiette, vegetable stock powder and reserved pasta water. Cook, stirring, until combined and heated through, 1-2 minutes. Season to taste. Remove from heat.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb814db53750fd705ece5/step-1e0859c1.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• In a large bowl, combine a drizzle of vinegar and olive oil. Season, then add pear and mixed salad leaves. Toss to coat.\n• Divide tomato, kale and pesto orecchiette between bowls. Sprinkle with shaved Parmesan cheese. Serve with pear salad. Enjoy!",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/63bfb814db53750fd705ece5/step-c8056443.jpg"
    }
  ]
